                        Option <function>logflag</function> introduced.
                    </para>
                </revdescription>
            </revision>
            <revision>
                <revnumber>2025.0.0</revnumber>
                <revremark>
                    Function returns the created handle(s).
                </revremark>
            </revision>
            <revision>
                <revnumber>2027.0.0</revnumber>
                <revdescription>
                    <para>
                        Non-rectangular grid mode added: <literal>grayplot(X,Y,Z)</literal> now
                        accepts three matrices of the same size for plotting on arbitrary grids.
                    </para>
                </revdescription>
            </revision>
        </revhistory>
    </refsection>
